	"control.expanded": {
		"$note": "State overlay for disclosure triggers: composed AFTER a control role so `[data-state=\"open\"]` can reach any control. It used to live inside control.ghost, where every pager and icon button silently inherited an accordion-shaped state. The background is deliberate, not decoration: it is what makes an open trigger readable once the pointer has left, and because it ties with `:hover`, the vocabulary's ordering is what decides that open wins.",
